{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31165","headline":"谢刘相寄天柱茶 · 薛能","name":"谢刘相寄天柱茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两串春团敌夜光，名题天柱印维扬。\n偷嫌曼倩桃无味，捣觉嫦娥药不香。\n惜恐被分缘利市，尽应难觅爲供堂。\n麤官寄与真抛却，赖有诗情合得尝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}